WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:10.780
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

00:00.520 --> 00:10.780
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:19.160 --> 00:25.540
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:19.160 --> 00:25.540
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.540 --> 00:29.750
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.540 --> 00:29.750
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.340 --> 00:39.220
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.340 --> 00:39.220
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:39.230 --> 00:45.070
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:39.230 --> 00:45.070
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:45.140 --> 00:51.860
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:45.140 --> 00:51.860
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:52.240 --> 00:58.030
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:52.240 --> 00:58.030
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.410 --> 01:06.650
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.410 --> 01:06.650
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.650 --> 01:12.800
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.650 --> 01:12.800
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.340 --> 01:16.670
doko made yukeru

01:13.340 --> 01:16.670
and go anywhere,

01:16.670 --> 01:24.890
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.670 --> 01:24.890
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:30.700 --> 01:34.270
I will tell you my real name.

01:35.220 --> 01:35.900
Beloved...

01:35.900 --> 01:37.360
to be loved.

01:38.120 --> 01:39.420
Don't ever forget that.

01:40.330 --> 01:45.590
Seimei, I would never forget that.

01:46.750 --> 01:51.480
Because I fear forgetting
more than anything.

01:56.010 --> 01:56.720
Beloved...

01:57.930 --> 02:04.560
A week after I heard that beautiful name, Seimei died.

02:10.820 --> 02:12.320
He was killed.

02:26.630 --> 02:27.580
Ritsuka?

02:28.040 --> 02:29.320
Ritsuka Aoyagi?

02:29.320 --> 02:32.690
A transfer student, in class 6-3.

02:32.690 --> 02:36.970
What are his parents thinking, sending
him here alone on his first day?

02:36.970 --> 02:40.140
There was an accident
at his last school.

02:40.140 --> 02:41.890
You mean, THAT accident?

02:43.350 --> 02:45.900
I hope Miss Shinonome will be all right.

02:45.900 --> 02:47.810
She's kind of flaky.

02:47.810 --> 02:51.520
She's 23 and she still has her ears.

02:51.940 --> 02:54.360
What's the new transfer student like?

02:54.360 --> 02:57.490
Well, I peeked in the
teacher's room earlier and...

03:00.790 --> 03:03.690
Yuiko, talk to him.

03:03.690 --> 03:05.540
What, me?

03:05.540 --> 03:07.900
Make sure you get his
number and email address too!

03:24.680 --> 03:27.010
Oh wow. He's cool.

03:27.890 --> 03:34.480
Ritsuka Aoyagi

03:28.940 --> 03:31.180
This is Ritsuka Aoyagi.

03:34.070 --> 03:36.450
I hope you will all
make friends with him.

03:36.450 --> 03:37.480
Let's see.

03:37.720 --> 03:39.690
There's a seat next to Hawatari.

03:40.270 --> 03:42.730
Aoyagi, please go sit over there.

03:44.450 --> 03:46.990
Okay, let's begin class.

03:48.210 --> 03:50.370
Open your textbooks to page 46.

03:50.370 --> 03:52.000
We'll continue where we left off.

03:52.750 --> 03:55.210
Ronta was given a
telescope by his father...

03:55.210 --> 03:56.570
Hey...

03:57.180 --> 03:58.400
...let me see your textbook.

03:58.400 --> 03:59.920
Right, of course!

04:00.240 --> 04:01.380
Here you go!

04:02.760 --> 04:05.520
My name is Yuiko Hawatari.

04:05.520 --> 04:06.550
Call me Yuiko!

04:06.860 --> 04:07.560
I won't.

04:08.340 --> 04:09.250
Why not?

04:09.770 --> 04:10.890
Why not! Why not!

04:11.110 --> 04:12.810
Call me Yuiko!

04:18.230 --> 04:22.200
Be sure jot down all the parts you don't understand, okay.

04:19.650 --> 04:22.200
Hey, Ritsuka.

04:23.470 --> 04:24.550
Um...

04:25.950 --> 04:28.170
Ritsuka, do you have a cell phone?

04:28.170 --> 04:30.200
Can Yuiko have your number?
Your email address, too!

04:30.200 --> 04:31.160
I don't have one.

04:31.960 --> 04:32.890
Why not?

04:32.890 --> 04:35.580
T-Then, who's your favourite idol?

04:35.580 --> 04:36.770
Yuiko likes Goma-chan.

04:36.770 --> 04:38.930
Goma-chan is so cute.

04:38.930 --> 04:40.380
Do you like Goma-chan?

04:40.750 --> 04:43.380
Why are you asking me this?

04:45.670 --> 04:46.820
Um...

04:46.820 --> 04:48.390
Everyone told me to ask you...

04:50.230 --> 04:52.770
Because you're cool, Ritsuka-kun.

04:52.770 --> 04:54.020
Hey, Yuiko!

04:54.020 --> 04:55.480
You're the one who said he's cool!

04:55.480 --> 04:58.860
Dream

04:55.690 --> 04:57.400
What do you mean, they want to know?

04:57.400 --> 04:58.860
We're in the middle of class!

04:59.450 --> 05:00.780
Yuiko pisses me off!

05:00.780 --> 05:02.300
She's such a blabbermouth.

05:03.700 --> 05:05.520
So, you're the gopher.

05:05.520 --> 05:09.080
People who are users are stupid, but
people who get used are even more stupid.

05:09.710 --> 05:11.160
I hate stupid people.

05:12.350 --> 05:13.290
Here, take it back.

05:16.750 --> 05:19.500
I'm... stupid?

05:25.220 --> 05:26.930
Yuiko, don't cry!

05:26.930 --> 05:29.220
You're despicable, making a girl cry like that!

05:29.220 --> 05:31.720
What's with that attitude of his?

05:55.500 --> 05:58.130
Come on, hurry up Yuiko!

05:58.130 --> 05:59.440
We gotta go!

06:02.340 --> 06:04.420
This place is the same.

06:04.420 --> 06:09.310
They call each other friends, but they are either using others or being used themselves.

06:09.310 --> 06:12.390
Seimei, life is boring.

06:13.140 --> 06:14.850
I wonder when will it end.

06:18.610 --> 06:20.500
What are you doing, Yuiko?

06:20.900 --> 06:22.530
Um, yeah...

06:25.320 --> 06:27.660
Let's eat!

06:27.660 --> 06:29.160
I don't like potatoes.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.110
Can I have it then?

06:30.370 --> 06:31.580
I don't like carrots.

06:31.580 --> 06:32.620
Me neither.

06:32.620 --> 06:34.490
They don't taste good.

06:34.490 --> 06:36.800
Hey, Yuiko, what are you looking at?

06:36.800 --> 06:37.330
Nothing.

06:44.650 --> 06:46.510
(Yanjounan Primary School Report on Ritsuka Aoyagi)

06:46.850 --> 06:47.890
Bye bye!

06:47.890 --> 06:48.800
Later!

06:54.020 --> 06:54.680
Ritsuka!

06:57.560 --> 07:00.060
Um... is it okay if we walked together?

07:00.060 --> 07:01.440
Yuiko, let's go.

07:02.440 --> 07:03.940
Get your bag!

07:08.240 --> 07:10.660
Um, Yuiko's going to walk
home with Ritsuka today!

07:10.660 --> 07:11.240
Sorry!

07:12.250 --> 07:13.490
What the...

07:13.490 --> 07:14.700
She pisses me off!

07:16.870 --> 07:17.750
Are you sure?

07:17.750 --> 07:18.160
Huh?

07:18.880 --> 07:20.120
They're going to leave you out.

07:21.630 --> 07:24.750
No way! They're my friends!

07:25.420 --> 07:27.030
Aoyagi!

07:29.220 --> 07:30.470
How was your first day?

07:30.980 --> 07:33.390
If you need anything, just tell me.

07:35.560 --> 07:36.780
Everything is fine.

07:36.780 --> 07:39.060
Besides, Hawatari is looking after me.

07:39.490 --> 07:41.060
Really, Hawatari?

07:41.570 --> 07:43.040
Please be nice to him.

07:43.440 --> 07:44.230
Yes.

07:44.230 --> 07:46.950
We're going to go to the public library.

07:46.950 --> 07:48.730
Goodbye, Miss Shinonome!

07:51.620 --> 07:53.990
Hey, Ritsuka, wait up!

07:55.430 --> 07:57.620
Why did you start running like that?

07:57.620 --> 07:58.240
What's wrong?

07:58.830 --> 08:02.460
It bugs me to have the
teachers worry about me.

08:03.590 --> 08:05.210
What does that mean?

08:05.210 --> 08:08.800
You startled me when you suddenly became so friendly in front of the teacher.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.050
You were like a different person...

08:10.050 --> 08:10.550
Don't say that!

08:12.680 --> 08:13.980
Don't ever say that again!

08:14.740 --> 08:16.340
What do you mean?

08:17.310 --> 08:18.510
I don't want you near me!

08:24.730 --> 08:26.560
R-Ritsuka...

08:30.380 --> 08:32.030
Who are you? You're not Ritsuka!

08:32.030 --> 08:34.410
Give Ritsuka back!

08:39.250 --> 08:39.990
Are you crying?

08:41.090 --> 08:42.330
What the...

08:42.720 --> 08:43.870
Let go of my arm.

08:43.870 --> 08:44.750
Who are you!

08:45.150 --> 08:46.360
You don't know?

08:46.360 --> 08:48.540
Why the hell would I know?
I said let go of me.

08:49.470 --> 08:52.310
I came because you wouldn't come for me.

08:53.640 --> 08:55.140
He doesn't have any ears.

08:55.140 --> 08:56.230
He's a grown-up!

08:56.890 --> 08:58.390
How do you know who I am?

08:59.640 --> 09:02.850
(Sentouki: Fighter)

08:59.640 --> 09:00.800
I'm a Sentouki.

09:01.230 --> 09:02.850
Seimei didn't tell you?

09:04.980 --> 09:06.260
Seimei...

09:08.690 --> 09:09.980
Are you a friend of my brother's?

09:11.240 --> 09:11.690
Yes.

09:13.660 --> 09:15.640
Are you a friend of Seimei's?

09:19.250 --> 09:20.660
Have you been to my house?

09:22.120 --> 09:24.330
What is your name?

09:28.920 --> 09:29.460
Soubi.

09:34.430 --> 09:37.380
Soubi, did you come to see me?

09:45.560 --> 09:47.650
Hey, do you have any spare time?

09:49.240 --> 09:52.900
Do you want to create
some memories with me?

09:56.990 --> 09:57.570
Sure.

09:58.410 --> 10:00.910
Whatever you want, Ritsuka.

10:13.970 --> 10:18.170
Someday this will change to snow...

10:18.640 --> 10:19.780
Seimei...

10:20.560 --> 10:22.990
I will always think of you...

10:23.810 --> 10:27.000
Because no one can ever replace you...

10:27.820 --> 10:29.540
But he...

10:29.540 --> 10:30.810
This grown-up is...

10:31.650 --> 10:33.190
This is making memories?

10:33.190 --> 10:34.190
Yeah, that's right.

10:34.190 --> 10:36.360
I'm going to print them out
later, so don't throw them away.

10:37.030 --> 10:39.860
This is nice, but let's talk.

10:40.580 --> 10:42.200
Won't that be more memorable?

10:42.200 --> 10:43.160
No!

10:44.250 --> 10:46.430
If you don't have
pictures, you'll forget!

10:46.430 --> 10:48.040
About me, that I even existed.

10:50.590 --> 10:52.420
I would never forget.

10:53.970 --> 10:54.920
You will forget.

11:06.940 --> 11:10.900
There's no point in making
memories with just anyone...

11:11.860 --> 11:15.240
But you're Seimei's friend...

11:16.320 --> 11:18.650
It means a lot to me...

11:20.510 --> 11:21.070
But...

11:22.580 --> 11:25.080
I didn't know Seimei
had a grown-up friend.

11:26.080 --> 11:27.540
My ears?

11:30.340 --> 11:31.480
Don't worry.

11:32.130 --> 11:34.960
I am an earless grown-up, but it's okay. I won't do anything.

11:41.970 --> 11:42.880
Strength.

11:43.600 --> 11:44.680
Give me strength.

12:01.450 --> 12:02.940
What are you doing?

12:02.940 --> 12:04.570
I can't believe it!

12:04.570 --> 12:07.490
Soubi, you said you
wouldn't do anything!

12:08.010 --> 12:08.990
Just a kiss.

12:08.990 --> 12:10.910
You said you wouldn't do anything!

12:20.260 --> 12:28.640
We now have to form a bond stronger than any bond between two people.

12:29.810 --> 12:31.600
B-Bond?

12:32.820 --> 12:33.490
Yes.

12:34.300 --> 12:35.520
So...

12:37.490 --> 12:39.320
S-Stop it.

12:43.580 --> 12:45.280
I will take you down.

12:46.250 --> 12:49.190
What does that mean?

12:57.170 --> 12:58.750
Another Sentouki.

13:03.910 --> 13:04.710
Ai!

13:05.760 --> 13:07.150
Found him.

13:08.100 --> 13:09.410
He's here.

13:09.410 --> 13:11.670
In this park, nearby...

13:11.670 --> 13:12.730
Is this...

13:13.610 --> 13:15.680
A match?

13:15.680 --> 13:17.320
That's not what you said!

13:19.570 --> 13:23.150
Soubi, what do you mean, take me down?

13:25.740 --> 13:27.610
Do you mean my ears?

13:29.250 --> 13:30.390
Not just yet.

13:32.960 --> 13:35.120
When you're a little more grown up.

13:38.460 --> 13:39.630
What should I do?

13:39.630 --> 13:41.220
Should I go for it?

13:41.220 --> 13:43.230
I don't think Ritsuka is ready, but...

13:44.260 --> 13:45.640
There's no mistake.

13:45.640 --> 13:47.800
That kid has a Sentouki.

13:48.390 --> 13:52.060
And a really big and strong one.

13:53.020 --> 13:54.850
I love you, Ritsuka.

13:56.150 --> 13:57.130
I love you.

13:57.650 --> 13:58.730
What's up with that?

13:58.730 --> 13:59.900
Are you making fun of me?

14:01.280 --> 14:02.430
I will protect you.

14:03.160 --> 14:05.390
I will do anything for you.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.780
I will give you anything.

14:09.580 --> 14:10.280
Anything?

14:11.500 --> 14:14.350
Yes, anything.

14:17.160 --> 14:20.250
My body, my heart and my soul.

14:20.630 --> 14:23.710
I would even give my life for you.

14:25.430 --> 14:26.170
Your life?

14:28.350 --> 14:30.860
I will fight for you.

14:30.860 --> 14:33.140
So don't be afraid.

14:33.890 --> 14:37.230
How can you say something like that?

14:37.940 --> 14:41.020
You'll give you life for me...
You love me...

14:41.020 --> 14:41.610
I can say it.

14:43.240 --> 14:44.370
Because I am a Spell.

14:44.950 --> 14:46.570
I control words.

15:02.260 --> 15:02.790
Hey!

15:05.420 --> 15:08.050
Loveless, we've come for you.

15:10.810 --> 15:12.570
Loveless?

15:13.020 --> 15:14.010
That would be you, Ritsuka.

15:15.490 --> 15:17.280
That's your real name.

15:17.720 --> 15:19.730
Loveless, one without love.

15:21.610 --> 15:23.280
What does that mean, Soubi?

15:23.280 --> 15:24.440
What is this about?

15:26.610 --> 15:30.430
Just like Seimei's
real name was Beloved.

15:32.080 --> 15:34.620
I will tell you my real name.

15:38.500 --> 15:42.960
Soubi, what are you to Seimei?

15:47.300 --> 15:49.320
I was Beloved's Sentouki.

15:49.760 --> 15:51.010
But now...

15:53.550 --> 15:56.140
I belong to you, Loveless.

15:56.460 --> 15:57.640
No way!

15:57.640 --> 16:00.650
A Sentouki can't serve two masters!

16:00.650 --> 16:03.870
Just because Beloved died doesn't mean that you can serve Loveless!

16:04.820 --> 16:07.610
That's... that's disgusting!

16:08.000 --> 16:09.360
Loveless, come here!

16:10.240 --> 16:12.540
Who are they?

16:13.660 --> 16:15.430
Don't worry about it, Ritsuka.

16:15.430 --> 16:19.790
Don't let those little
birds come between us.

16:22.130 --> 16:26.090
Soubi, I don't understand...

16:26.090 --> 16:29.230
Who are they? Who are you?

16:29.720 --> 16:33.200
But for some reason, I am crying...

16:33.200 --> 16:34.380
Why?

16:35.390 --> 16:37.290
Midori, let me fight.

16:37.290 --> 16:39.900
Soubi doesn't have a shred of pride.

16:39.900 --> 16:40.640
How dare he!

16:40.660 --> 16:43.310
I know. This is part of our job.

16:44.440 --> 16:47.610
I declare this to be a battle of spells.

16:47.610 --> 16:48.900
He's challenging us.

16:49.150 --> 16:50.000
We accept!

16:50.860 --> 16:52.710
I'm on auto.

16:52.710 --> 16:53.740
Auto?

16:54.210 --> 16:56.570
Sentou system, on!

17:00.870 --> 17:02.410
You're going to fight
just with the Sentouki?

17:02.680 --> 17:03.830
Don't mock us!

17:03.960 --> 17:05.040
Midori!

17:06.960 --> 17:08.460
We are one soul.

17:08.460 --> 17:09.920
One name.

17:09.920 --> 17:12.710
We're Breathless, so fierce
it's impossible to breathe.

17:13.160 --> 17:14.800
Sentou system, on!

17:17.140 --> 17:20.720
Ritsuka, keep your eyes closed.
I promise to protect you.

17:21.150 --> 17:21.970
Here goes!

17:22.420 --> 17:23.810
(Burst)

17:22.420 --> 17:23.810
Retsu!

17:23.810 --> 17:25.620
Rip him apart!

17:27.100 --> 17:28.730
(Complete Defense)

17:27.100 --> 17:28.730
Zen Kai Bou Gyo!

17:29.950 --> 17:31.430
Four characters in one breath?!

17:31.430 --> 17:33.320
A simple spell won't work.

17:34.370 --> 17:36.530
No attack can reach me.

17:36.870 --> 17:37.860
(Burst)

17:36.870 --> 17:37.860
Retsu-Pa!

17:37.860 --> 17:39.360
Rip him apart

17:39.360 --> 17:40.860
Destroy him!

17:42.370 --> 17:44.000
It's pointless.

17:44.000 --> 17:46.940
Your crude spell won't work on me.

17:48.840 --> 17:51.160
Now it's my turn to attack.

17:51.160 --> 17:53.130
Midori is going to get hurt.

17:53.800 --> 17:54.970
Don't listen to him!

17:54.970 --> 17:58.180
Don't get confused! I am your Sacrifice!

17:58.180 --> 18:01.350
I'm willing to take the damage!

18:04.230 --> 18:05.980
Sacrifice?

18:07.070 --> 18:09.270
Ai is not strong enough
to protect Midori.

18:09.560 --> 18:10.270
What?

18:10.520 --> 18:13.440
Calm down, Ai. He's just trying to provoke you.

18:16.030 --> 18:17.710
I don't understand.

18:18.950 --> 18:21.410
Soubi, are you evil?

18:21.580 --> 18:24.120
That's right! He's a filthy grown-up!

18:24.710 --> 18:25.920
(Torrent)

18:24.710 --> 18:25.920
Hon-Ryu!

18:25.920 --> 18:29.960
Let this sacred water
cleanse the evil filth!

18:36.760 --> 18:37.710
Pointless.

18:40.930 --> 18:43.620
There is no good nor evil here.

18:44.100 --> 18:46.180
Nor is there purity or filth.

19:03.460 --> 19:05.620
B-But...

19:06.830 --> 19:09.670
Let's leave this place. I want to
take us away from here.

19:11.130 --> 19:11.960
Are you running away?

19:12.880 --> 19:14.440
To some place where slumber is possible.

19:14.440 --> 19:16.340
Take the two little birds.

19:17.340 --> 19:18.510
Little birds?

19:42.490 --> 19:44.660
So we weren't going to run away?

19:45.830 --> 19:49.570
We initiated the match.
We can't withdraw.

19:53.460 --> 19:57.130
Did... did they die?

19:57.840 --> 19:58.970
You're cute.

19:59.970 --> 20:01.360
What does that mean?

20:01.890 --> 20:03.430
Explain it to me!

20:05.640 --> 20:07.350
I love you, Ritsuka.

20:11.110 --> 20:12.320
Put me down.

20:13.730 --> 20:17.690
Let me hold you... a little while longer.

20:21.450 --> 20:24.070
I can't believe you were
sent back like "little birds."

20:24.070 --> 20:25.280
It was Soubi!

20:25.280 --> 20:28.230
Beloved died, but he's still alive!

20:29.170 --> 20:31.500
He dishonors the Sentouki.

20:31.500 --> 20:32.720
Breathless...

20:34.250 --> 20:36.960
You must not bring a Sentouki here.

20:37.910 --> 20:38.380
No!

20:39.550 --> 20:40.880
Ai and I are always together.

20:43.340 --> 20:45.640
Honestly, you two...

20:46.430 --> 20:50.640
Breathless, do you
want to try again, or...

20:50.640 --> 20:54.230
I will defeat him and
bring Loveless. I promise.

21:03.990 --> 21:08.150
He was gone when I opened my eyes...

21:09.290 --> 21:12.120
Is he really my brother's friend?

21:14.420 --> 21:16.470
That battle, and everything else...

21:17.090 --> 21:19.660
Was it all an illusion that he created?

21:23.360 --> 21:28.220
But I have 50 memories, right here.

21:28.220 --> 21:33.180
To be continued...

21:30.010 --> 21:39.560
Setsunasa no kagiri made dakishimete mo

21:30.010 --> 21:39.560
Even if I hold you with all my suffering,

21:40.360 --> 21:49.870
itsu made mo hitotsu ni wa narenakute

21:40.360 --> 21:49.870
we still can't be one.

21:50.450 --> 22:00.380
Yasashisa yori fukai basho de fureau no wa itami dake

21:50.450 --> 22:00.380
The only thing that we can feel deep within besides kindness is pain,

22:00.790 --> 22:08.390
futari wo musunde kudasai

22:00.790 --> 22:08.390
so please, bind the two of us together.

22:10.930 --> 22:15.760
Bokura wa mou yume wo minai

22:10.930 --> 22:15.760
We no longer dream anymore,

22:15.770 --> 22:20.910
tomadoinagara te wo totte

22:15.770 --> 22:20.910
when you're wavering, take my hand

22:21.190 --> 22:30.120
zankoku na yoake no hou e arukidasu

22:21.190 --> 22:30.120
as we tread towards the cruel light of dawn.

22:31.240 --> 22:41.250
Hontou no kotoba wa kitto hontou no sekai no dokoka

22:31.240 --> 22:41.250
I'm sure real words are somewhere in the real world.

22:41.590 --> 22:50.470
Bokura no mukuchi na yoru ni hisonderu

22:41.590 --> 22:50.470
They lurk in the shadows of our silent nights.

22:50.840 --> 22:55.970
Ima mo kitto

22:50.840 --> 22:55.970
Surely, even now...

23:00.980 --> 23:02.290
Oh my.

23:02.290 --> 23:04.780
Ritsuka, that's a dangerous
expression you're wearing.

23:04.780 --> 23:09.990
If you look like that, someone
will come and take you away.

23:09.990 --> 23:11.210
Shut up!

23:11.210 --> 23:12.370
I don't want to hear it.

23:12.370 --> 23:14.360
But you will need me.

23:14.750 --> 23:17.810
Only I can fight for you.

23:18.590 --> 23:21.210
Tale two, Memoryless.

23:22.420 --> 23:24.590
It may be painful, but can you bear it?
